WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.378 --> 00:00:03.618
Remove the catalog-price workaround (stored USD price for Basic Support)

2
00:00:03.618 --> 00:00:04.174
Reverse the phantom-priced draft INV-000002 through the invoice page

3
00:00:04.174 --> 00:00:06.739
Restore the White Rabbit hourly contract

4
00:00:06.739 --> 00:00:09.194
Give White Rabbit a billing email (required to issue an invoice; cleared again at the end)

5
00:00:09.194 --> 00:00:24.785
Generate from Automatic Invoices with no catalog price: the contract rate and 15-minute terms price the time

6
00:00:24.785 --> 00:00:30.268
Open the new draft: the UI shows $425.00, 0.25 h lines at $100.00, $25.00 each

7
00:00:30.268 --> 00:00:39.928
Regenerate: Automatic Invoices offers nothing for the same time, so it is not billed twice

8
00:00:39.928 --> 00:00:45.150
Restore: terminate the disposable contract again; the corrected draft is kept
